<h3><u>Tamam alam me aaj matam</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Tamaam aalam may aaj matam, hussain bekas ka ho raha hai<br />
alam gharon may sajay huway hai, dilon may farsh-e-aza bicha hai<br />
tamaam aalam may aaj matam, hussain bekas ka ho raha hai</p>

<p>1. Siyah kapde siyah chadar, ghamon ki gardo ghubaar sar par<br />
hai sogwaro&#39;n kay ashk jaari, ke sani-e-zehra berida hai<br />
tamaam aalam ...</p>

<p>2. Na chashme purnam ho kyon sawali, juloos hai zuljanah khaali<br />
ke mera duldul sawar-e-maula, zamin-e-karbal may so raha hai<br />
tamaam aalam ...</p>

<p>3. Alam me mashq-e-sakina dekho, to momino bas yeh keh ke rolo<br />
chacha bhatiji may kya hai nisbat, wafa-e-abbas kya wafa hai<br />
tamaam aalam ...</p>

<p>4. Hussain peeri may dil sambhale, ke dil se uljhi sina nikaale<br />
jawaan beta lahu may dooba, zameen pe aedi ragad raha hai<br />
tamaam aalam ...</p>

<p>5. Na maar barchi dil-e-nabi par, abhi huway hai jawaan akbar<br />
ye qatl jisko tu kar raha hai, yehi to ham shakl-e-mustafa hai<br />
tamaam aalam ...</p>

<p>6. Madinay walo khamosh rehna, ghareeb zainab say kuch na kehna<br />
basa huwa ghar jo le gayi thi, wo karbala may ujad gaya hai<br />
tamaam aalam ...</p>

<p>7. Azaa-e-shabbir hai ibadat, janab-e-zainab ki hai amaanat<br />
ye nauha tere qalam se mehshar, janab-e-zahra ki ek ataa hai<br />
tamaam aalam ...</p>
</p>